hy royal throne, <br /></li><li>Take my love; my Lord, I pour <br />\nAt thy feet its treasure-store. <br />\nTake myself, and I will be <br />\nEver, only, all for thee, <br />\nEver, only, all for thee. <span class=\"smallcaps\" style=\"font-variant:small-caps;\">Amen.</span></li></ol>\n</div>\n</div>&#32;\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw\u2010api\u2010ext.eqiad.main\u20107c87c5b46f\u2010jtd9p\nCached time: 20261020105536\nCache expiry: 2592000\nCache expiry source: Module:Header (os.date(%Y))\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary\u2010page\u2010id, vary\u2010revision\u2010sha1]\nCPU time usage: 0.223 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.354 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 591/1000000\nRevision size: 573/2097152 bytes\nPost\u2010expand include size: 17964/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5547/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 15/100\nExpensive parser function count: 2/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 2/20\nUnstrip post\u2010expand size: 10949/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.096/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1805210/52428800 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 0/500\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  334.928      1 -total\n 36.31%  121.615      1 Template:Header\n 33.74%  113.011      1 Template:Hymn/header\n 32.88%  110.127      1 Template:Music/header\n 21.38%   71.620      1 Template:Missing_score\n 17.99%   60.249      1 Template:Hymn/verses\n 17.17%   57.503      1 Template:Block_center\n 13.29%   44.528      1 Template:Pmbox\n  7.55%   25.297      1 Template:*!/s\n  7.34%   24.583      1 Template:Category_handler\n-->\n\n<!-- Render ID c778089f-cc74-11f1-8b6a-553251df75f2 -->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key enwikisource:pcache:1867411:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261020105536 and revision id 13800249. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}}}